        <p>
          The dashboard is connected, not a list:
        </p>
        <div class="eq-block" role="img" aria-label="Repeat households times visits per household times conversion times average transaction equals core food revenue; orders divided by direct labor hours equals labor productivity; revenue divided by occupied parking-space-hours equals site productivity.">
          <span>repeat households × visits per household × conversion × avg. transaction = <strong>core food revenue</strong></span>
          <span>orders ÷ direct labor hours = <strong>labor productivity</strong></span>
          <span>revenue ÷ occupied parking-space-hours = <strong>site productivity</strong></span>
        </div>
