          <li><strong>No icon:</strong> no leaf, lantern, or other logo symbol accompanies the wordmark.</li>
          <li><strong>Supporting copy:</strong> Source Sans 3 — regular (400) for body, semibold (600) for interface labels, bold (700) with 0.08–0.22em tracking for uppercase eyebrows.</li>
          <li><strong>Color:</strong> wordmark in Lantern Black (#1F241E) or Parchment (#F4EFE5) on dark grounds; palette values as swatched below.</li>
