      <!-- ============ Roadmap ============ -->
      <section id="roadmap" class="plan-section">
        <span class="eyebrow">08 · Roadmap & Milestones</span>
        <h2>Validate first. Build second.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          The concept is worth pursuing; the permanent site is not yet a financeable conclusion
          on the numbers alone. The lowest-risk path validates demand through two full seasons of
          temporary programming — pop-up markets, a Halloween event, mobile cider-and-donut
          service, school pilots, and rented-space holiday markets — before committing capital
          for an autumn 2030 opening. Pilots must answer the real remaining question: can Leaf
          &amp; Lantern generate enough repeat visitation and non-autumn utilization to reach
          roughly 85–90k annual food transactions without a $4M+ operating asset?
        </p>

        <div class="roadmap">
