        </div>

        <p>
          An existing code-compliant building with adequate utilities could compress the schedule
          and permit an autumn 2029 launch; a raw site or contested land-use approval could push
          the opening to 2031. The base plan holds autumn 2030 as the target.
        </p>

        <h3>Validation gates before permanent construction</h3>
