          parcel-specific feasibility model (including land and 2030-dollar construction), a
          contractor-priced development budget screened against the ~$4M all-in gate, and a
          month-by-month operating forecast with 40k/55k/70k/85k/90k transaction scenarios,
          weather loss, and bottom-up labor. The next-stage documents must establish whether a
          particular property can deliver the concept without forcing Leaf &amp; Lantern to become
